 ## Supported platforms
 
-Debian bookworm.
+Debian bookworm and Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9 and compatible distributions.
+
+The package and service names come from `vars/<os_family>.yml`. On Debian the
+service is `ssh`; on RedHat it is `sshd`. The package is `openssh-server` on both.
